        <p class="mb-3"><strong>Govt. Graduate College, Civil Lines, Sheikhupura</strong> is one of the established higher education institutions serving students in Sheikhupura and surrounding areas. The college began its journey on <strong>11 August 1959</strong> as a Degree College, with the government reserving <strong>376 kanals</strong> of land for the institution. In <strong>1971</strong>, the Intermediate College was merged with the Degree College, further expanding its educational role.</p>
